            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714590/extras/8c8a60385121e93db4df20a24f7941ca.poster.avif?t=1780698412\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714590/extras/8c8a60385121e93db4df20a24f7941ca.webm?t=1780698412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714590/extras/8c8a60385121e93db4df20a24f7941ca.mp4?t=1780698412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of OLDTV, comes a unique sequel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produced with love and an undying will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backup the internet with an incredible soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlock hidden characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gain weird skills &amp; abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Don't break up with your girlfriend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover Secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BACKOFSPACE</strong> is the spiritual sequel to OLDTV.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OLDTV introduced a new game idea, and now we're building a game that lights that idea on fire. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NAUSEA, VERTIGO, COLORBLINDNESS:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is not recommended for people who suffer from neurological issues such as sensitivity to developing nausea or if you have an underlying issue such as vertigo or colorblindess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE OF AI:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game product uses AI generated art in it's background per region. You can read more about the terms of usage here:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714590/extras/8c8a60385121e93db4df20a24f7941ca.poster.avif?t=1780698412\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714590/extras/8c8a60385121e93db4df20a24f7941ca.webm?t=1780698412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714590/extras/8c8a60385121e93db4df20a24f7941ca.mp4?t=1780698412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of OLDTV, comes a unique sequel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produced with love and an undying will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backup the internet with an incredible soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlock hidden characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gain weird skills &amp; abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Don't break up with your girlfriend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover Secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BACKOFSPACE</strong> is the spiritual sequel to OLDTV.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OLDTV introduced a new game idea, and now we're building a game that lights that idea on fire. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NAUSEA, VERTIGO, COLORBLINDNESS:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is not recommended for people who suffer from neurological issues such as sensitivity to developing nausea or if you have an underlying issue such as vertigo or colorblindess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE OF AI:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game product uses AI generated art in it's background per region. You can read more about the terms of usage here:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "short_description": "2027, a solar flare will wipe out all satellites in 16 days. A sole nerd flies drones into the stratosphere to backup the internet. Your activity is criminal &amp; illegal. Become the most hated man in 2027, without breaking up with your girlfriend.",
